OL,3,GNEWSAAsian hornet sting risk rising as
OL,4,Anests increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FMary Le Hegarat, Minister for
OL,7,FEnvironment, Agriculture and Fisheries,
OL,8,Fsaid more than 800 hornet nests had
OL,9,Fbeen identified in Jersey so far this
OL,10,Fyear, a 50% increase compared with the
OL,11,Fsame point in 2025.
